@* Idle-lock landing (F-15). IdleGuard force-navigates here at the inactivity deadline, which tears down
   the working circuit — so all in-memory case data is gone and this neutral page is all that remains on
   an unattended screen. AllowAnonymous + the chromeless layout mean it always renders and shows nothing
   sensitive. "Resume" is a full-page link back to the app, which re-authenticates (silently under
   Windows auth) and starts a fresh session. *@
@page "/session-expired"
@layout Layout.BlankLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Session locked — CaseBook</PageTitle>

<div class="session-locked">
    <div class="session-locked-card">
        <div class="session-locked-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bi bi-lock-fill"></span></div>
        <h1 class="session-locked-title">Session locked</h1>
        <p class="session-locked-text">
            You were signed out here because of inactivity. Anything you saved is safe; an edit you were still
            typing when the session locked may need to be redone.
        </p>
        <p class="session-locked-text session-locked-muted">
            This is a security measure for unattended workstations. Please also lock your computer when you step away.
        </p>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Resume session</a>
    </div>
</div>
